{"id":"u23","kelas":9,"no":5,"judul":"Present Perfect","title":"Have You Ever ...?","emoji":"🧳","ringkas":"Pengalaman dan kejadian sampai sekarang","ready":true,"goals":["membentuk **present perfect**: [[have / has + past participle]]","menceritakan **pengalaman**: [[I have visited Bali.]], [[Have you ever eaten durian?]]","memakai [[ever]], [[never]], [[already]], [[yet]], [[just]] dengan benar","memakai [[for]] dan [[since]] untuk durasi","membedakan **present perfect** dan **simple past**"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"\"Kamu **pernah** ke Bali?\" \"Aku **sudah** mengerjakan PR.\" \"Aku **sudah lama** tinggal di sini.\" Semua ini memakai **present perfect**, tense yang menghubungkan **masa lalu dan sekarang**. Inilah topik **Unit 5 Kelas 9**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rumus present perfect","text":"Rumus: **have / has + past participle** (kata kerja bentuk ketiga, yang sudah kamu pelajari di Unit 3).","table":[["Subjek","Bantu","Contoh"],["I / you / we / they","**have**","[[I have visited Bali.]]"],["he / she / it","**has**","[[She has finished her homework.]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"Negatif: [[I haven't seen that movie.]] / [[He hasn't called me.]]","id":"Tambahkan not setelah have/has."},{"en":"Pertanyaan: [[Have you eaten?]] — [[Yes, I have.]] / [[No, I haven't.]]","id":"Pindahkan have/has ke depan."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Singkatan","text":"**I have = I've**, **she has = she's**, **have not = haven't**, **has not = hasn't**. Contoh: [[I've finished.]] / [[She hasn't come.]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Kapan memakai present perfect?","table":[["Fungsi","Contoh","Artinya"],["**Pengalaman** (waktu tidak disebut)","[[I have been to Bali.]]","Aku pernah ke Bali."],["**Hasil sekarang**","[[I have lost my pen.]]","Penaku hilang (dan sekarang tidak ada)."],["**Baru saja / sudah**","[[She has just left.]]","Dia baru saja pergi."],["**Berlangsung sampai sekarang**","[[I have lived here for five years.]]","Aku sudah tinggal di sini lima tahun."]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Ever, never, already, yet, just","table":[["Kata","Artinya","Dipakai di","Contoh"],["**ever**","pernah","pertanyaan","[[Have you ever eaten durian?]]"],["**never**","tidak pernah","kalimat positif (maknanya negatif)","[[I have never seen snow.]]"],["**already**","sudah","kalimat positif","[[I have already done my homework.]]"],["**yet**","belum / sudah","negatif dan pertanyaan, di **akhir** kalimat","[[I haven't finished yet.]] / [[Have you eaten yet?]]"],["**just**","baru saja","kalimat positif","[[He has just arrived.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Never bukan haven't never","text":"**Never** sudah bermakna negatif, jadi jangan ditambah not. Benar: [[I have never been to Bali.]] Salah: *I haven't never been to Bali.*"},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. For dan since","table":[["Kata","Dipakai dengan","Contoh"],["**for**","**lama waktu** (durasi)","[[I have studied English for three years.]] / [[for two hours]], [[for a long time]]"],["**since**","**titik waktu awal**","[[I have studied English since 2023.]] / [[since Monday]], [[since I was ten]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[How long have you lived here?]] — [[I have lived here for ten years.]]","id":"Sudah berapa lama kamu tinggal di sini? — Sudah sepuluh tahun."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Present perfect atau simple past?","text":"Perbedaannya: simple past memakai **waktu selesai yang jelas**; present perfect **tidak menyebut waktu** atau menghubungkan ke sekarang.","table":[["","Simple past","Present perfect"],["**Waktu**","jelas dan sudah lewat (yesterday, last year, in 2020)","tidak disebut, atau sampai sekarang"],["**Contoh**","[[I visited Bali last year.]]","[[I have visited Bali.]] / [[I have visited Bali three times.]]"],["**Pertanyaan**","[[When did you visit Bali?]]","[[Have you ever visited Bali?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Tidak boleh dengan waktu lampau yang jelas","text":"Jangan pakai present perfect bersama **yesterday**, **last week**, **in 2020**, atau **ago**. Benar: [[I saw him yesterday.]] Salah: *I have seen him yesterday.*"},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Pengalaman","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, have you ever been to Bali?","id":"Dina, apakah kamu pernah ke Bali?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes, I have. I've been there twice. And you?","id":"Ya, pernah. Aku sudah ke sana dua kali. Kamu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"No, I haven't. I've never been to Bali, but I've visited Yogyakarta.","id":"Belum. Aku belum pernah ke Bali, tapi aku pernah ke Yogyakarta."},{"who":"Dina","en":"When did you go to Yogyakarta?","id":"Kapan kamu pergi ke Yogyakarta?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I went there last year. I have lived in Indonesia for three years now.","id":"Aku ke sana tahun lalu. Aku sudah tinggal di Indonesia tiga tahun sekarang."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Present perfect = [[have / has + past participle]].","Pengalaman: [[Have you ever ...?]]; belum pernah: [[never]]; sudah: [[already]]; belum: [[yet]]; baru saja: [[just]].","[[for]] + lama waktu, [[since]] + titik awal.","Waktu lampau yang jelas (yesterday, last year) → **simple past**."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["ever","pernah"],["never","tidak pernah"],["already","sudah"],["just","baru saja"],["yet","belum"]],"exp":"Kata-kata ini sering muncul dalam present perfect.","k":"45bf459a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sudah mengunjungi Bali.","q":"I ___ visited Bali.","answers":["have","'ve"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"I → have.","k":"135a7a8a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sudah menyelesaikan PR-nya.","q":"She ___ finished her homework.","answers":["has"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"She → has.","k":"7e6ba9e9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah kamu pernah makan durian?","q":"Have you ___ eaten durian?","answers":["ever"],"hint":"e _ _ _","exp":"ever = pernah (di pertanyaan).","k":"701a0f7e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku belum pernah melihat salju.","q":"I have ___ seen snow.","answers":["never"],"hint":"n _ _ _ _","exp":"never = tidak pernah.","k":"084d1f38"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sudah tinggal di sini selama lima tahun.","q":"I have lived here ___ five years.","answers":["for"],"hint":"for / since ?","exp":"Lama waktu → for.","k":"0f5ce6e4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sudah belajar bahasa Inggris sejak 2023.","q":"I have studied English ___ 2023.","answers":["since"],"hint":"for / since ?","exp":"Titik waktu awal → since.","k":"af9832f6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I have saw that movie.","I have seen that movie.","I has seen that movie.","I have see that movie."],"answer":1,"exp":"have + seen (past participle).","k":"e9a25e9d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has go to school.","She has went to school.","She has gone to school.","She have gone to school."],"answer":2,"exp":"has + gone.","k":"dfc9f5cc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I have visited Bali last year.","I visited Bali last year.","I have visit Bali last year.","I has visited Bali last year."],"answer":1,"exp":"Waktu lampau yang jelas (last year) → simple past.","k":"d8ecc1c7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I haven't finished yet.","I haven't finished already.","I haven't never finished.","I hasn't finished yet."],"answer":0,"exp":"yet di akhir kalimat negatif.","k":"37b1f4cc"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia baru saja tiba.\"","answer":"He has just arrived.","exp":"Subjek + has + just + past participle.","k":"1c1c026f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah kamu sudah makan?\"","answer":"Have you eaten yet?","exp":"Have + you + past participle + yet?","k":"7b42a0b9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat untuk \"Have you finished?\" (belum) adalah...","options":["No, I haven't.","No, I didn't.","No, I don't.","No, I hasn't."],"answer":0,"exp":"Have you ...? → No, I haven't.","k":"cb6952fc"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"Have you ever been to Bali","options":["Apakah kamu pernah ke Bali?","Kapan kamu ke Bali?","Apakah kamu akan ke Bali?","Di mana Bali?"],"answer":0,"exp":"ever been to = pernah ke.","k":"309161aa"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Berapa lama?","say":"I have lived here for ten years","options":["Sepuluh tahun sampai sekarang","Sepuluh hari yang lalu","Sejak sepuluh tahun lalu hingga kemarin","Tahun depan"],"answer":0,"exp":"for ten years = selama sepuluh tahun (sampai sekarang).","k":"41048834"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan past participle:","pairs":[["eat","eaten"],["go","gone"],["see","seen"],["write","written"],["do","done"]],"exp":"Past participle.","k":"37915e12"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan for atau since dengan contohnya:","pairs":[["for","two hours"],["since","Monday"],["ever","dipakai di pertanyaan"]],"exp":"for = durasi; since = titik awal.","k":"43f234fe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I have finished my homework.","I has finished my homework.","I have finish my homework.","I finished have my homework."],"answer":0,"exp":"have + finished.","k":"7ae4aeb4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has never seen snow.","She has never saw snow.","She have never seen snow.","She hasn't never seen snow."],"answer":0,"exp":"has never seen.","k":"a12b544b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["They have lived here for five years.","They have lived here since five years.","They has lived here for five years.","They live here since five years."],"answer":0,"exp":"for + durasi.","k":"7c2f0136"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He has studied English since 2022.","He has studied English for 2022.","He studied English since 2022 now.","He have studied English since 2022."],"answer":0,"exp":"since + titik awal.","k":"392110e3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Have you ever been to Bali?","Did you ever been to Bali?","Have you ever go to Bali?","Do you ever been to Bali?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Have you ever been ...?","k":"b9b96bb4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Has she finished yet?","Does she finished yet?","Has she finish yet?","Is she finished yet?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Has + she + past participle?","k":"28382d14"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat untuk \"Have you eaten?\" (sudah) adalah...","options":["Yes, I have.","Yes, I did.","Yes, I am.","Yes, I has."],"answer":0,"exp":"Have you ...? → Yes, I have.","k":"04eb1a7b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang memakai simple past dengan benar?","options":["I saw him yesterday.","I have seen him yesterday.","I have saw him yesterday.","I seen him yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"yesterday → simple past.","k":"9c0fdf73"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang memakai present perfect dengan benar?","options":["I have just arrived.","I have just arrive.","I just have arriving.","I has just arrived."],"answer":0,"exp":"have just + V3.","k":"aa04a3a6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sudah menyelesaikan tugasnya.","q":"She has ___ her task. (finish)","answers":["finished"],"hint":"finish + ed","exp":"finished.","k":"619b7fd2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku belum pernah makan sushi.","q":"I have ___ eaten sushi.","answers":["never"],"hint":"n _ _ _ _","exp":"never.","k":"2907f865"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah kamu sudah mengerjakan PR?","q":"Have you done your homework ___?","answers":["yet"],"hint":"y _ _","exp":"yet.","k":"6bb1d584"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sudah mengenalnya selama dua tahun.","q":"I have known him ___ two years.","answers":["for"],"hint":"f _ _","exp":"for + durasi.","k":"7b6233af"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sudah pergi ke Bali tiga kali.\"","answer":"He has been to Bali three times.","exp":"has been to + tempat + ... times.","k":"b3fc9a89"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku belum makan siang.\"","answer":"I haven't had lunch yet.","exp":"haven't + V3 + yet.","k":"e5a3c904"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Sudah berapa lama kamu tinggal di sini?\"","answer":"How long have you lived here?","exp":"How long + have + you + lived + here?","k":"b8d35718"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pengalamannya?","say":"I have been to Yogyakarta twice","options":["Dua kali ke Yogyakarta","Satu kali ke Yogyakarta","Belum pernah ke Yogyakarta","Akan ke Yogyakarta"],"answer":0,"exp":"twice = dua kali.","k":"bf601f93"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang terjadi?","say":"He has just left","options":["Dia baru saja pergi","Dia akan pergi","Dia tidak pernah pergi","Dia pergi kemarin"],"answer":0,"exp":"just left.","k":"8d5b76a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"I have lived in Bandung for ten years. I have visited Bali twice. I haven't been to Lombok yet.\" Berapa kali penulis ke Bali?","options":["Dua kali","Sepuluh kali","Sekali","Belum pernah"],"answer":0,"exp":"twice.","k":"e5183a29"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca teks di atas. Apa yang belum dilakukan penulis?","options":["Pergi ke Lombok","Pergi ke Bali","Tinggal di Bandung","Tinggal di Bali"],"answer":0,"exp":"haven't been to Lombok yet.","k":"286f64c3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Dina has just finished her homework. She has already cleaned her room. She hasn't eaten dinner yet.\" Apa yang belum dilakukan Dina?","options":["Makan malam","Mengerjakan PR","Membersihkan kamar","Mandi"],"answer":0,"exp":"hasn't eaten dinner yet.","k":"b5cd8098"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Have you ever eaten durian?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Yes, I have. It's delicious.","Yes, I did yesterday I have.","No, I don't.","I ate it ever."],"answer":0,"exp":"Have you ever ...? → Yes, I have.","k":"9499362c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"How long has she lived here?\" B: \"She has lived here ___ 2020.\"","options":["since","for","ago","in since"],"answer":0,"exp":"since + titik awal.","k":"a9e3015a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I have seen him yesterday.","I saw him yesterday.","I have seen him before.","I haven't seen him today."],"answer":0,"exp":"yesterday → simple past.","k":"32a633ae"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She have finished.","She has finished.","They have finished.","I have finished."],"answer":0,"exp":"She → has.","k":"045ea6f7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I have never ate sushi.","I have never eaten sushi.","I have eaten sushi.","I haven't eaten sushi."],"answer":0,"exp":"have + eaten.","k":"2336b443"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dia sudah pergi ke luar negeri dua kali\" adalah...","options":["He has been abroad twice.","He has go abroad twice.","He is abroad twice.","He went abroad two."],"answer":0,"exp":"has been.","k":"d9814bd7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Aku belum selesai\" adalah...","options":["I haven't finished yet.","I didn't finish already.","I have not finishing.","I am not finished yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"haven't ... yet.","k":"9b95d2dd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["yesterday","ever","never","already"],"answer":0,"exp":"yesterday = simple past.","k":"96a24e1c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sudah makan.","q":"I have ___ eaten.","answers":["already"],"hint":"a _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"already.","k":"b8dc5309"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia baru saja pergi.","q":"She has ___ left.","answers":["just"],"hint":"j _ _ _","exp":"just.","k":"58ff32b3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami tinggal di sini selama tiga tahun.","q":"We have lived here ___ three years.","answers":["for"],"hint":"f _ _","exp":"for.","k":"9c68f40a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku mengenalnya sejak kecil.","q":"I have known her ___ I was a child.","answers":["since"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"since.","k":"3096e41f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku belum pernah melihat salju.\"","answer":"I have never seen snow.","exp":"have never + V3.","k":"02ab81ce"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah dia sudah menelepon?\"","answer":"Has she called yet?","exp":"Has + she + V3 + yet?","k":"d1c48556"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang terjadi?","say":"I have already done my homework","options":["Aku sudah mengerjakan PR","Aku belum mengerjakan PR","Aku akan mengerjakan PR","Aku mengerjakan PR kemarin"],"answer":0,"exp":"already done.","k":"a518fa7d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Berapa lama?","say":"He has worked here for six years","options":["Enam tahun","Enam bulan","Enam hari","Enam minggu"],"answer":0,"exp":"six years.","k":"b2c543c5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu bertanya, \"Have you finished your homework?\" Kamu sudah selesai. Jawabanmu?","options":["Yes, I have.","Yes, I did yesterday I have.","Yes, I am.","Yes, I has."],"answer":0,"exp":"Yes, I have.","k":"61384781"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Seseorang bertanya, \"Have you ever been to Yogyakarta?\" Kamu belum pernah. Jawabanmu?","options":["No, I haven't. I've never been there.","No, I didn't ever.","No, I never have been there not.","No, I haven't never been."],"answer":0,"exp":"haven't.","k":"b5deedc5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["already","allready","alredy","alreadi"],"answer":0,"exp":"already.","k":"ce661cc9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["finished","finnished","finised","finishd"],"answer":0,"exp":"finished.","k":"295bcef2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar? (past participle)","options":["written","writen","writtin","writted"],"answer":0,"exp":"written.","k":"e5418cf2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ long have you lived here?\"","options":["How","Who","Where","What"],"answer":0,"exp":"How long.","k":"8f5b1786"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ have you been to?\" (Bali dan Lombok.)","options":["Where","Who","When is","How old"],"answer":0,"exp":"Where.","k":"0276f3d8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"I have ___ seen that movie.\" (belum pernah)","options":["never","ever","yet","already not"],"answer":0,"exp":"never.","k":"f7638166"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"She has ___ left.\" (baru saja)","options":["just","yet","ever","n